=> start

~ start
A frail fragment: You see two hooded figures approaching. They unveil a scroll and then speak. 
A frail fragment: The Elders were apparently told you've been constantly badmouthing the Goddess ever since you got here, and ordered your banishment from the village. Who would do this?
A frail fragment: Either way, the Elders believed them. A Culling day is approaching, and they don't need another inconvenience. 
A frail fragment: The two cultists come and grab you by the shoulders. You try to resist but they punch you in the stomach and you pass out. 
A frail fragment: ...You[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_exile")] later find yourself outside the village walls as the sky turns red. 
A frail fragment: After a few minutes of wandering around, you start to feel blisters on your skin. [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_death")]You can feel them suck the life out of you. They hurt more than anything you could have ever imagined. 
A frail fragment: In mere seconds, you're dead. 
do DialogueFuncs.unlock_achievement("Brats - Those pesky children...")
